---
title: Proposed Forge Studio worker - durable build attempt
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor M as Main JS thread
    participant R as Browser Rust
    participant S as JS I/O worker
    participant F as Forge host
    participant D as Studio database
    participant W as Build worker
    M->>R: Forward build action
    R->>S: Emit typed dispatch effect
    S->>F: Dispatch game.build.submit
    Note over F,D: Reject before storage effects if admission fails.
    F->>F: Check session, project and typed request
    F->>D: Commit job and queued event using idempotency key
    D-->>F: Durable receipt
    F-->>S: Return build ID and state
    S-->>R: Deliver correlated receipt
    R-->>M: Publish build view
    W->>D: Claim job with lease and attempt token
    D-->>W: Pinned revision and approved profile
    W->>W: Build in isolation and store verified artifact by digest
    W->>D: Attach artifact and finish current attempt
    Note over D,W: An expired or superseded attempt cannot attach its result.
    M->>R: Reconnect or refresh build status
    R->>S: Request admitted status
    S->>F: Dispatch game.build.get
    F->>D: Read authorized job and ordered events
    D-->>F: Status and committed artifact metadata
    F-->>S: Return typed status
    S-->>R: Deliver correlated status
    R-->>M: Publish status and authorized preview
